---
layout: layout.njk
title: FAQ
description: Plain-English answers to the most important PAPR raffle, draw timing, and transparency questions.
---
<main>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <article class="hero-card panel" data-reveal>
      <p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p>
      <h1>The questions people ask when they want to trust a raffle platform.</h1>
      <p>PAPR’s FAQ should answer operational, legal, and public-trust questions without burying supporters in vague marketing or unexplained operator jargon.</p>
    </article>
    <aside class="hero-aside panel" data-reveal>
      <p class="kicker">Approach</p>
      <h2>Plain language beats fuzzy reassurance.</h2>
      <p>The FAQ should explain the room state, timing, and outcome path in direct language and point to the fuller rules when needed.</p>
    </aside>
  </section>

  <section class="section panel" data-reveal>
    <div class="accordion">
      {% for item in faqs %}
      <article class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-toggle" type="button" aria-expanded="false">
          <strong>{{ item.question }}</strong>
          <span>+</span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-panel">
          <p>{{ item.answer }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
